          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfbfc;--accent:#7cc9b8;--deep:#214b43;--muted:#6b6b6b;--card:#ffffff}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:var(--deep);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%, #f2fbf8 100%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 32px;background:transparent}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#b3e8db);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#053022;font-weight:700;font-size:18px}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--deep);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:48px 32px 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;align-items:center;gap:32px}\\n    .hero .copy{max-width:54ch}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:var(--deep);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(33,75,67,0.06)}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .pill{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .pill .dot{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#d6f3ea);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--deep)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    footer{padding:28px 32px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    /* diagonal split */\\n    .diagonal{position:absolute;right:-20%;top:0;width:160%;height:100%;transform:skewX(-12deg);transform-origin:0 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f6fffb 0%,rgba(123,214,195,0.06) 60%);pointer-events:none}\\n    /* pattern */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"400\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 400 160\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"g\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"%237cc9b8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"%23000000\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.02\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\\\"none\\\"><rect width=\\\"400\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"/><g stroke=\\\"%230b3b33\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.03\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.6\\\"><path d=\\\"M0 20c20 8 40 -8 60 -12s40 6 60 6 40 -14 60 -10 40 18 60 14 40 -22 60 -18\\\"/></g><g fill=\\\"url(%23g)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"><circle cx=\\\"40\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"200\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"2\\\"/></g></g></svg>');background-repeat:repeat;opacity:0.9;mix-blend-mode:multiply;pointer-events:none}\\n    @media (max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:28px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{padding:16px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\"><div class=\\\"logo\\\">H</div><div>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">A membership for whole-person vitality</div>\\n    </div></div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Start</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Care Path</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"pattern\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"diagonal\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"copy\\\">\\n        <h1>Membership-based integrative care for steady, sustainable wellbeing</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We combine nutrition, lifestyle coaching, gentle diagnostics, and supportive therapies to help you move from overwhelm to grounded resilience. Membership focuses on prevention, learning, and ongoing refinement of your care plan.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Monthly plans that bundle coaching, priority visits, and community workshops — educational in scope, personalized in plan.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <strong style=\\\"display:block;margin-bottom:8px\\\">What members receive</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\">1</div><div><strong>Initial intake</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">In-depth history & whole-person assessment</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\">2</div><div><strong>Personalized plan</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Diet, sleep, stress tools & optional labs for clarity</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\">3</div><div><strong>Ongoing support</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Monthly check-ins, messaging, and educational workshops</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Memberships are educational and supportive; they are not a promise of cure. Results vary by individual.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"padding:36px 32px 12px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Core offerings</h3>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Comprehensive intake & lifestyle mapping</li>\\n            <li>Personalized nutrition & sleep strategies</li>\\n            <li>Stress resilience and breathwork sessions</li>\\n            <li>Evidence-informed supplement guidance</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Add-ons & labs</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">Optional educational laboratory testing may be recommended only to inform the plan. These are explained, never obligatory.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"width:300px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Quick note</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Our approach centers learning and small practical shifts. Membership is best for those ready to explore steady change rather than quick fixes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"padding:18px 32px 60px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Stories from the practice</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Case note: A member adopting a 12-week sleep routine with small evening rituals reported deeper sleep and improved daytime focus. This illustrates education + consistent habits, not a guaranteed outcome for everyone.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">Join as a member</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div>Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Concerns & Conditions — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff9f5;--accent:#f7b267;--deep:#3b2f2f;--muted:#6b5e5e}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--deep);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff)}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 28px}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--deep);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{padding:28px 28px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .intro{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    main{padding:22px 28px}\\n    .list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}\\n    .item{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(59,47,47,0.04)}\\n    .item h4{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    /* decorative svg stripe */\\n    .stripe{height:78px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(247,178,103,0.08),transparent);position:relative;overflow:hidden}\\n    .stripe svg{position:absolute;right:-40px;top:-10px;opacity:0.18}\\n    @media (max-width:860px){.list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How Care Works</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Common concerns we support</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"intro\\\">Educational, integrative strategies to help you better understand and manage common patterns of imbalance. We focus on whole-person context rather than single quick fixes.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Membership model</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"note\\\">Ongoing education, not a one-time promise.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"stripe\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"240\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 240 120\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"a\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"%23f7b267\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"%23ef9a6b\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\\\"url(%23a)\\\"><circle cx=\\\"40\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"20\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"100\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"8\\\"/></g></svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <h4>Stress & overwhelm</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Chronic stress affects sleep, digestion, and immunity. We teach nervous-system tools, pacing strategies, and lifestyle supports to reduce reactivity. Note: practices support resilience; they are not guarantees.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <h4>Poor sleep</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Sleep is addressed with routine-building, light exposure, and evening habits. Sometimes labs are educationally suggested to explore contributors — not to diagnose on their own.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <h4>Digestion & gut discomfort</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Dietary patterns, mindful eating, and supportive supplements may be discussed. Investigation is careful and explanatory; interventions are individualized.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <h4>Low energy & fatigue</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">We look at sleep, diet, stress, and movement. Where helpful, optional labs can provide context; we interpret results to teach and empower decisions.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <h4>Chronic inflammation</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Lifestyle shifts, anti-inflammatory food emphasis, and stress reduction are core strategies. We do not promise reversal; we support better understanding and consistent habits.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\">\\n        <h4>Mind-body balance</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Breathwork, gentle movement, and reflective practices are taught to build emotional regulation and mental clarity over time.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n      <h3>Common questions</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <strong>Are tests required?</strong>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">No. Labs are optional and educational. Recommendations come with clear explanations and choices.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <strong>Is this medical care?</strong>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">This practice uses integrative approaches. When medical issues or emergencies arise, we coordinate with your medical providers and recommend appropriate care.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Start a conversation</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;padding:12px;background:#fff6f0;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n      <strong>Disclaimer:</strong>\\n      <span class=\\\"note\\\">Our services are educational and supportive. We never promise cures. Individual outcomes vary and depend on many factors.</span>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer style=\\\"padding:20px 28px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Our Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f4fbff;--accent:#6fa8ff;--deep:#0b3a66;--muted:#5b6b7a}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:var(--deep);background:var(--bg)}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px}\\n    .brand{font-weight:800}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--deep);text-decoration:none}\\n    .mast{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:32px 28px}\\n    .split{flex:1}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;padding:0 28px 36px}\\n    .step{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(11,58,102,0.06)}\\n    .step h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .labs{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}\\n    .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--deep);color:white;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    /* subtle diagonal left */\\n    .left-diag{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:36%;height:100%;transform:skewX(-10deg);transform-origin:0 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(111,168,255,0.06),transparent);pointer-events:none}\\n    .svg-bg{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;opacity:0.08}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mast{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"left-diag\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <svg class=\\\"svg-bg\\\" width=\\\"220\\\" height=\\\"220\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 220 220\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"lg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"%236fa8ff\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"%23bde0ff\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\\\"url(%23lg)\\\"><rect x=\\\"10\\\" y=\\\"10\\\" width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"170\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"28\\\"/></g></svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Plans</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Common Concerns</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"mast\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"split\\\">\\n        <h1>A gentle, evidence-informed pathway: intake to ongoing refinement</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">Our model is membership-centered — steady support, clearer education, and adaptive plans that evolve with you.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <aside style=\\\"width:320px;background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(11,58,102,0.05)\\\">\\n        <strong>Ready to learn together?</strong>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0\\\">Start with a conversation. We’ll co-create next steps that make sense for your life.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"steps\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3>1. Intake & story-gathering</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A comprehensive intake explores your medical history, lifestyle rhythms, stressors, and priorities. The aim is clarity — we listen first, then educate.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3>2. Personalized plan</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Plans include practical diet and sleep guidance, stress tools, movement suggestions, and prioritized small experiments. We present options with rationale so you can choose what fits.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3>3. Optional educational labs</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">When helpful, we may suggest non-invasive lab tests as educational tools to illuminate patterns. These are optional and always explained in plain language; lab results inform discussion, not unilateral commands.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"labs\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\"></div><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Examples: nutrient markers, basic inflammation panels, metabolic snapshots</div></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3>4. Follow-up & iterative care</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Follow-ups refine the plan, troubleshoot barriers, and celebrate sustainable wins. Membership offers scheduled check-ins and messaging so small changes accumulate over time.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"padding:0 28px 56px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px;background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(11,58,102,0.04)\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Collaborative education</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We prioritize teaching: why a suggestion might help, what to expect, and how to measure progress. This empowers sustainable habit change.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"width:320px;background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(11,58,102,0.04)\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Coordination of care</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">When medical care is needed, we communicate and coordinate with your providers so plans are safe, sensible, and complementary.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer style=\\\"padding:20px 28px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>Questions? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div>Call {{PHONE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
